OL,3,GNEWSAHot air balloon pilot wins second
OL,4,Aworld title
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hot air balloon pilot from Shropshire
OL,7,Fhas reclaimed his world championship
OL,8,Ftitle.
OL,10,FDominic Bareford, from Oswestry, won
OL,11,Fthe FAI World Hot Air Balloon
OL,12,FChampionship, which took place in
OL,13,FKrosno, Poland, last month.
OL,15,FHe took part in five flights across the
OL,16,Fweek and topped the points table ahead
OL,17,Fof 100 other pilots, after previously
OL,18,Fwinning the title in 2018.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
