OL,3,GNEWSAHot air balloon pilot wins second
OL,4,Aworld title
OL,5,
OL,6,FBareford, who equalled his father's
OL,7,Frecord, said he had not been sure if he
OL,8,Fcould win again as the sport was so
OL,9,Ftough: "I didn't really think about it
OL,10,F[reclaiming the title] that much during
OL,11,Fthe week, so maybe that was a good
OL,12,Fthing,"
